# Korean is the DEFAULT locale, so its content lives in docs/ and its theme
# strings come from Docusaurus' bundled ko translations. An i18n/ko/ directory
# is therefore dead weight - but a bare `write-translations` (no --locale)
# recreates it. Ignored so it stops reappearing in commits.
# If ko ever stops being the default locale, DELETE THIS RULE - it would then
# hide real translations.
/i18n/ko
